{
  "_id": "shardssilkarchr1",
  "name": "Стрелок Шёлковых шапочек",
  "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/npc.svg",
  "notes": "<p>An archer of the Шёлковые шапочки, Мирайя's people, a generic type fought in pairs. Archers take the high places and the dark corners, and each one picks a mark and keeps shooting it until someone runs at Мирайя. They carry shortswords for when the fight reaches them, and would rather it did not. Human ancestry is assigned for play, not canon. Table notes: Marked Quarry has two toggles (the target is the quarry; this is the first hit this round); Double Shot is a toggle for its -2 penalty.</p>",
