  "actions": [
    {
      "name": "Marked Quarry",
      "type": "action",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "text": "<p>The archer marks one creature it can see as its quarry. It gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Seek] the quarry, and it ignores the penalty for attacking the quarry in its second range increment. The first time the archer hits the quarry in a round, it deals an additional 1d8 precision damage. These effects last until the archer uses Marked Quarry again.</p>",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "RollOption",
          "option": "marked-quarry",
          "toggleable": true,
          "label": "Target is the marked quarry"
        },
        {
          "key": "FlatModifier",
          "selector": "perception",
          "type": "circumstance",
          "value": 2,
          "predicate": [
            "action:seek",
            "marked-quarry"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "RollOption",
          "domain": "ranged-attack-roll",
          "option": "ignore-range-penalty:2",
          "predicate": [
            "marked-quarry"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "RollOption",
          "option": "first-attack",
          "toggleable": true,
          "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Ranger.HuntersEdge.FirstAttack"
        },
        {
          "key": "DamageDice",
          "selector": "strike-damage",
          "category": "precision",
          "diceNumber": 1,
          "dieSize": "d8",
          "predicate": [
            "marked-quarry",
            "first-attack"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Double Shot",
      "type": "action",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "flourish"
      ],
      "text": "<p>The archer shoots twice in quick succession. It makes two composite shortbow Strikes, each against a different target and each with a -2 penalty. Both attacks count toward its multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after both are made.</p>",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "RollOption",
          "domain": "ranged-attack-roll",
          "option": "double-shot",
          "toggleable": true,
          "label": "Double Shot"
        },
        {
          "key": "FlatModifier",
          "selector": "ranged-attack-roll",
          "slug": "double-shot",
          "value": -2,
          "predicate": [
            "double-shot"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Covering Fire",
      "type": "reaction",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy the archer can see within 60 feet moves into a square adjacent to one of the archer's allies</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The archer makes a composite shortbow Strike against the triggering enemy.</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "Surprise Attack",
      "type": "passive",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "<p>On the first round of combat, creatures that haven't acted yet are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] to the archer.</p>",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "EphemeralEffect",
          "predicate": [
            "encounter:round:1",
            {
              "lt": [
                "self:participant:initiative:rank",
                "target:participant:initiative:rank"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "selectors": [
            "strike-attack-roll",
            "spell-attack-roll",
            "strike-damage",
            "attack-spell-damage"
          ],
          "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Swift Sneak",
      "type": "passive",
      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "<p>The archer can move its full Speed while @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak]{Sneaking}.</p>"
    }
  ],
